ant crossroads of trade routes, Osh has seen various cultures and empires, including the Persian and Turkic influences, which have shaped its ethnically diverse population. The city has played an integral role throughout various historical epochs, particularly during the Silk Road's prominence, serving as a vital commercial hub connecting East and West.

